* The Pirate King's island, reached only as his prisoner (ship.c moves the
* Sea Wren's passengers to the brig when Blackwake takes the ship, and
* locks their belongings in sea chests, obj 4300, in the store).  Escape
* through the loose plank, the store key on the mess hall hooks, the
* King's logbook, the King in the lighthouse, and the longboat home to
* Vice Island (one way).
*
